{
  "name": "vertex_node_band_cap — vertex-node faces are capped by the delivering band depth (AUDIT-FIXES B1, H5)",
  "comments": {
    "hand": [
      "Same statics as asym_case_b1 (independently hand-solved there): Ls = 240; P1 = 140 k at 60; P2 = 70 k at 180 (1.4D);",
      "z = 138.963571, H = 52.891560, y2 = z*5250/7350 = 99.259694; fce*tw = 17.2125 k/in; hp = 140.5; yt = 3.5.",
      "Adjacent segment vertical band depths at V2 (dVert = H/(fce*tw*cos^2 alpha)):",
      "  arch.1: alpha = atan2(y2-z, 120) = -18.307607 deg -> dVert1 = 52.891560/(17.2125*0.949385^2) = 3.409250 in;",
      "  arch.2: alpha = atan2(-y2, 60) = -58.848101 deg -> dVert2 = 52.891560/(17.2125*0.517309^2) = 11.482660 in.",
      "PRE-B1 the vertical extent was bounded only by the envelope: haNode_old = 2*min(hp-y2, y2+yt) = 2*(140.5-99.259694)",
      "= 82.480612 in -> face toward arch.2 = 10*sin(58.848101) + 82.480612*cos(58.848101) = 51.225944 in — 4.5x wider than",
      "the 11.48 in band that actually delivers the force (the audit's ~131 in class of overstatement).",
      "B1 cap: haNode = min(2*(hp-y2), 2*(y2+yt), max(dVert1, dVert2)) = min(82.480612, 205.519388, 11.482660) = 11.482660 in.",
      "Faces (w = w_v*|sin a| + haNode*|cos a|, w_v = 10 in):",
      "  toward arch.1: 10*0.314123 + 11.482660*0.949385 = 3.141234 + 10.901430 = 14.042636 in;",
      "  toward arch.2: 10*0.855885 + 11.482660*0.517309 = 8.558852 + 5.940082 = 14.498070 in.",
      "Band-fit consequence (also asserted in asym_case_b1): arch.2 avail = min(14.498070, wsR 24.160332) = 14.498070,",
      "fitDcr = 5.940082/14.498070 = 0.409715."
    ]
  },
