        { "path": "results.model.nodePolygons[id=node.vertex.2].faces[2].width_in", "value": 14.498069634529571, "rtol": 1e-6, "note": "face toward arch.2: 10*0.855885 + 11.482660*0.517309 = 14.498070 in — pre-B1 the envelope bound gave 51.225944 in, wider than the 11.482660 in delivering band" },
